f0ab" facs="#m-d5e60566-05ec-4bf1-9f46-82fe2b2eedaf" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelil secundum Lucam.</l><l xml:id="m-47107615-82d6-44fc-9a29-5b2b899ab968" facs="#m-b49b5a9f-8ad3-4592-b757-85f22bfa143e" label="ambiguous">Luc. 2.</l><l xml:id="m-3a937dcc-d0db-4a57-b0a5-ab6923f2fc7b" facs="#m-9cd4a050-6204-46d2-9cb0-c0495744eaa9" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Exiit edictum a lántes, et custodiéntes vigslias noctis</l><l xml:id="m-89eb7402-f837-4ee5-b260-b2c20bca75c4" facs="#m-f1120bed-0a9c-46fd-be9c-b3b1643e3686" label="lyrics-like">L Caésare Augústo, ut describeré¬</l><l xml:id="m-c3c176c1-7fbf-4818-b578-f5d1dbf8d79f" facs="#m-5ddcbf9f-f43c-4811-8847-a8fe6d86baef" label="ambiguous">super gregem suum. Et ecce Ange¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8dd78b5-ee19-4e03-9cdb-403a8c05982d" facs="#m-a0e26fc8-6e6a-429e-8141-f201bb2899f7" label="lyrics-like">tur univérsus orbis. Haec descríptio</l><l xml:id="m-a97a1096-e0c4-4ba0-9410-1f2a4f48ca0a" facs="#m-9c57065f-c6ee-4984-81fd-a0f57f22368c" label="lyrics-like">lus Dómini stetit juxta illos, et clá¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ff6a54d-ba53-4670-ac25-935642afd121" facs="#m-2a8bd182-e3b3-4c60-a528-d6bef8c306b1" label="lyrics-like">prima facta est a praéside Syriae</l><l xml:id="m-a566663e-b237-47b3-86d4-777ef2570853" facs="#m-d6ed9871-b764-4fcc-9ba0-1c5e53000bfe" label="lyrics-like">ritas Dei circumfúlsit illos, et timué¬</l><l xml:id="m-8c4c9af1-aaa6-4bad-b805-8360d02cfec9" facs="#m-9b75f523-5f17-4ab2-ac4f-15ddd432e3cc" label="ambiguous">Cyrino: et ibant omnes ut profite¬</l><l xml:id="m-d613f7a3-506a-4107-b47b-0ac0d93aeda6" facs="#m-c03a2f70-7c9a-4732-937d-4c07903351f5" label="lyrics-like">runt timóre magno. Et dixit illis</l><l xml:id="m-3f930015-937e-4400-b866-c9231d7d5512" facs="#m-eca3d1be-81a2-4853-8177-e162e6de392f" label="lyrics-like">réntur sínguli in suam civitátem.</l><l xml:id="m-dd024dea-1391-4ab0-9c65-0032f4fe974e" facs="#m-317df713-3ba5-46f6-81b6-65098e0ae33a" label="lyrics-like">Angelus: Nolite timére: ecce enim</l><l xml:id="m-f53612fa-ff0a-474d-a415-4a5ca38ec411" facs="#m-e7931fce-04d5-4ff6-9215-7a0e0ecdb775" label="lyrics-like">Ascéndit autem et Joseph a Galilaéa</l><l xml:id="m-b2db5236-8f11-4438-a541-e087e2e48b1a" facs="#m-0769e9c1-8cd7-40b4-a914-67d2bb30e0a3" label="lyrics-like">evangelízo vobis gáudium magnum,</l><l xml:id="m-f902c3be-56a1-4435-82ca-d87b819c7217" facs="#m-97e65a7a-c258-4ac3-aec6-e9c91a4c8f77" label="lyrics-like">de civitáte Názareth, in Judaéam in</l><l xml:id="m-6cdf743a-1b8f-4ae5-b9ea-b721ae0de230" facs="#m-583b4683-ffdf-448d-874b-34a983a5ae02" label="lyrics-like">quod erit omni pópulo: quia natus</l><l xml:id="m-d856dfdd-0ad2-4aa3-8bca-2ece1662a1dc" facs="#m-70717dcc-5d52-4191-9342-840816bbaee4" label="lyrics-like">civitátem David, quae vocátur Béth¬</l><l xml:id="m-7867cd00-36bf-4c4b-8ea7-1fefe3607ac4" facs="#m-10d8aaa6-ff7a-443d-8816-75dbd30aabc3" label="lyrics-like">est vobis hódie Salvátor, qui est</l><l xml:id="m-9c2d9e5c-dd21-4037-8d61-f01f57d05d7b" facs="#m-6299d9ea-612c-4e4b-a209-8b608e30f04f" label="ambiguous">lehem: eo quod esset de domo et</l><l xml:id="m-d695ec8b-0050-4eb5-867f-dd983ea77cd4" facs="#m-840b2a22-b507-4896-a38e-0b435014bef0" label="lyrics-like">Christus Dóminus, in civitá̂te Da¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b6254d3-3aca-46bf-9332-343caa03781e" facs="#m-97f22fa5-14c4-4857-a72b-0c82afdc525b" label="lyrics-like">familia David, ut profiterétur cum</l><l xml:id="m-809e4faf-52dc-4669-866a-e5861b881f64" facs="#m-bed482d0-ac60-46eb-8b54-53a4c233dfc5" label="lyrics-like">vid. Et hoc vobis signum : Inveniétis</l><l xml:id="m-a06d0810-8d19-4d6b-bccf-33c155d9b543" facs="#m-82a2f830-4301-49fa-8507-b32a66ce2c95" label="lyrics-like">María desponsáta sibi uxóre prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-a5aadf74-c0bb-43bd-bb35-a72176e9ddf4" facs="#m-98030ce8-6db7-433f-82c5-62ef5d512c1c" label="lyrics-like">infántem pannis involútum. et pó¬</l><l xml:id="m-57ebd66a-aaad-4fa9-baa8-bda8d6b19e19" facs="#m-3951c7c0-f76f-4f78-9a74-a77d691eeb5b" label="lyrics-like">situm in praesépio. Et súbito facta</l><l xml:id="m-af2baaeb-ede3-499f-b83f-313dc7cf58ef" facs="#m-e9c8f252-ed37-4eb7-9609-e991c9ffd613" label="lyrics-like">gnánte. Factum est autem, cum es¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c2bdf46-c86e-439f-bba5-b400febd6739" facs="#m-f4d0017e-8b52-4313-8bbf-5b85966fed58" label="lyrics-like">sent ibi, impléti sunt dies ut páreret.</l><l xml:id="m-eecc295d-b763-469a-9693-382c3454fe97" facs="#m-4c275d93-ef70-4859-92de-53bc84725b57" label="lyrics-like">est cum Angelo multitúdo militiae</l><l xml:id="m-ff23a8f3-25ff-4482-892f-637509b4dae7" facs="#m-138c2efc-6502-4ad4-84a3-3e0903cbe1db" label="lyrics-like">Et péperit filium suum primogéni¬</l><l xml:id="m-27548ff8-c025-4ebe-be46-73aee8a93fea" facs="#m-6c9d2864-2683-4e1f-92e5-af05a1dcb2da" label="lyrics-like">caeléstis, laudántium Deum, et di¬</l><l xml:id="m-d8b731d7-afe6-4aec-806b-830d9afb48e8" facs="#m-303f2d03-6059-44e8-9880-2d0998e57d0f" label="lyrics-like">centium : Glória in altíssimis Deo,</l><l xml:id="m-e86db600-5c63-47fa-aabc-4a9b45d6a3c5" facs="#m-6587e639-4c38-4f42-a030-0aa03cbc3ac2" label="lyrics-like">tum, et pannis eum invólvit, et re¬</l><l xml:id="m-832c518c-33fd-4164-88c6-e625cbae07a2" facs="#m-872667d2-3e67-4a2c-bfb7-7b1dc88293e5" label="lyrics-like">clinávit eum in praesépio: quia non</l><l xml:id="m-9f686e3e-55be-4977-a5c1-b4280bcb6eee" facs="#m-a9cd29f3-032c-4e98-ae09-fc3c28f738fa" label="lyrics-like">et in terra pax homínibus bonae</l><l xml:id="m-c4a191d4-0ca9-45f3-ac59-7467f5204dd0" facs="#m-be765c86-2854-4277-94b9-e251811a34b2" label="lyrics-like">erat eis locus in diversório. Et pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-01f60538-4e8d-4fa5-985c-0a6192c74eea" facs="#m-ca8e209e-512c-4028-bc4c-63edfabf74c2" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-55bbf2b9-18d2-453d-9524-c548c9d9a1fc" facs="#m-9c9ed593-1d32-4956-aced-c9d20eaf7d4e" label="lyrics-like">voluntátis.</l><l xml:id="m-a7f825a3-6dbf-4882-9874-9d2926200e0e" facs="#m-6fe157a4-f1be-40f9-a1dd-d573f680a517" label="lyrics-like">stóres erant in regióne eádem vigi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ba89bb4-4c98-4439-9bd2-622d5934b07e" facs="#m-67d76fb9-58bb-41a5-8f42-70b42221cb5e" label="ambiguous">orert.E</l><l xml:id="m-577479ee-14d1-4ed5-a1d9-52dca09bd46f" facs="#m-d60e0fbe-72b4-4e1d-b69d-30cd0db22fcb" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-a4e8e5d0-e66f-42c6-8de9-631552842e91" facs="#m-f5f04987-2d22-42f4-859f-00ec2d952051" label="ambiguous">L</l><l xml:id="m-e7613dbf-9c64-4a4f-a416-062dc3753576" facs="#m-e31b48f4-b648-4014-a013-735370574679" label="ambiguous">li</l><l xml:id="m-f2489221-7fa2-4c4b-88aa-44075195d808" facs="#m-2742e665-746d-42d4-ae04-552ad7107760" label="lyrics-like">Aeténtur “ caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-37270696-ecc1-457c-ad52-e8a04ec73759" facs="#m-bf19cd7b-16cd-4fb3-ba87-b45d4819cc9f" label="lyrics-like">et exsúl¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3d79e9e-3aef-471e-ac3a-fb5290fa82ea" facs="#m-736ed860-74d1-4b78-abc3-1605807b4b26" label="lyrics-like">tet tér¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
